{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12335","headline":"山园栖隐 · 钱起","name":"山园栖隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"守静信推分，灌园乐在兹。\n且忘尧舜力，宁顾尚书期。\n晚景采兰暇，空林散帙时。\n卷荷藏露滴，黄口触虫丝。\n三径与嚣远，一瓢常自怡。\n情人半云外，风月讵相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12335.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12335","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}